        <activityName xml:lang="en">Platinum, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Platinum, at regional storage
The consumer mix is an assembly of the primary platinum transported from ZA and RU for consumption in Europe and secondary platinum recovered and consumed in RER according to the global market share in 2002.;
UUID: 7a020379-c844-32ff-8fde-fb468f6661b5
Primary PGM transported from ZA and RU for consumption in Europe and secondary PGM recovered and consumed in RER.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: European consumer mix
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 52.4 t / a
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7a020379-c844-32ff-8fde-fb468f6661b5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
